Through Time, Space and Species</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2506">SCP-2506</a> - Niles is a Fixer</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2603">SCP-2603</a> - Its Maiden Voyage (an <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mobile-task-force-contest">MTF2016 contest</a> entry)</li> </ul> <h3><span><strong>Tales authored</strong></span></h3> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-longest-ride">The Longest Ride</a> - Couriers have the worst days.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-princess-and-the-ogre">The Princess and the Ogre</a> - Because they can't all be betentacled horrors from beyond the veil.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dead-end">Dead End</a> - Why we should keep tabs on prototypes.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/supply-and-demand">Supply and Demand</a> - The Chaos Insurgency supplies what third-world dictators demand.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-urge-that-betrays">The Urge that Betrays</a> - When stingrays start spewing from the vents</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/faith">Faith</a> - One day, in an abandoned farmhouse, an old widower and a widower try to create the heart of a boy.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/unraveled">Unraveled</a> - Don't pick at scabs.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/cavalcade-hub">Cavalcade</a> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/cav-006">Stuck</a> - A tale of three Seattles for the price of one.</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/goi-contest-2014">The 2014 GoI Contest</a> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/family-ties">Family Ties</a> - This is what happens when you try to break up Herman Fuller's family.</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/resurrection">Resurrection</a> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/just-a-formality">Just A Formality</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/december-24th-2011-hub">December 24th, 2011</a> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-lost-shepherd">The Lost Shepherd</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mobile-task-force-contest">The 2016 MTF Contest</a> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/black-lotus">Black Lotus</a> - co-author credits</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <h3><span><strong>Other works:</strong></span></h3> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/goi-contest-2014">For the 2014 GoI Contest</a> <ul> <li>Herman Fuller Presents: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-flame-faced-man">The Flame-Faced Man</a></li> <li>Herman Fuller Presents: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-fishman-of-manasquan">The Fishman Of Manasquan</a></li> <li>Herman Fuller Presents: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-living-head">The Living Head</a></li> <li>Herman Fuller Presents: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-amazing-sluggo">The Amazing Sluggo</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <h3><span><strong>Artwork relevant to works on the wiki:</strong></span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-281</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-281</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://daily-scp.tumblr.com/post/122668091289/62815-scp281-the-snooze-alarm-scp-281-is-a" target="_blank"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/crayne-author/tumblr_nqkze7BGpb1tmu7ero1_1280.jpg" width="300px" alt="tumblr_nqkze7BGpb1tmu7ero1_1280.jpg" class="image" /></a><br /> Original artwork by <a href="http://daily-scp.tumblr.com">Gbroxey</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-1119</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfo