&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A picture I made for Fae for &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2532&quot;&gt;SCP-2532&lt;/a&gt; that he has not used ._. I also made this for fun&lt;/p&gt;
