&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-7&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;And on that day that Amuness Trovolock Creeps had set his eyes on the pieces of fan art he received, he died from happiness.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; I had gotten permission to post the fanart on my author page&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scpsandbox2.wdfiles.com/local--files/amuness-creeps/2341-atp.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;2341-atp.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was of a fan made SCP done by &lt;a href=&quot;http://corporationofmoo.deviantart.com/gallery/&quot;&gt;CorporationOfMoo.&lt;/a&gt; SCP-2341-ATP was basically a box that if you put something in it, you forgot it. The &amp;quot;ATP&amp;quot; suffix was of my previous username &amp;quot;AmunessThePooper&amp;quot; which I &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;really&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; don&#039;t want anyone to refer to be by that name&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scpsandbox2.wdfiles.com/local--files/amuness-creeps/2341fanart.png&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;2341fanart.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
