 for the Foundation to contain them. Feel free to add to it, but be aware that it is regularly pruned.</li> </ul> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone series"> <p><a name="tales"></a></p> <h1><span>SCP Tales Mainlist</span></h1> <p>Below, you can find recreations of each Series list which include all on-site works that star, reference, or otherwise include individual SCPs, slotted conveniently beneath each entry for your reading pleasure.</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-1-tales-edition">SCP Series 1 - Tales Edition</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-2-tales-edition">SCP Series 2 - Tales Edition</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-3-tales-edition">SCP Series 3 - Tales Edition</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-4-tales-edition">SCP Series 4 - Tales Edition</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-5-tales-edition">SCP Series 5 - Tales Edition</a></li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608692367" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span></p> 
