 <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-500">One (1) instance of SCP-500</a><br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Denied; what would happen iff not the odd event it disappeared?</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> Fur from one (1) cocker spaniel<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Fur from an unknown species; subject terminated</p> </blockquote> <p>Testing is to continue until further notice</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7141604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608692368" alt="TheKidNamedCover" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7141604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" >TheKidNamedCover</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-702029-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. SCP-XXXX-3</div> </div> 
