&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black&quot;&gt;Access to this file restricted to personnel with Level 4 or higher Delta (Δ) clearance set. Attempt to access file without necessary clearance will be logged and result in immediate disciplinary action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
