&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-801492-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. Reality Perception Resistance Examination; See MD Publication: &lt;em&gt;Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy&lt;/em&gt; pp 304-330&lt;/div&gt;
