					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Dr.Gutierrez &lt;<span class="wiki-email">rc.PiCS|zerreitug.b#rc.PiCS|zerreitug.b</span>&gt;</strong><br /> <strong>Fri 1/25/2019&#160;9:28 AM</strong><br /> <strong><span class="wiki-email">ten.PiCS|zevahc.g#ten.PiCS|zevahc.g</span></strong></p> <p>Gabriel,</p> <p>Sorry this took so long. New position left me pretty swamped. Archiving is already enough of a pain in the ass, now imagine doing so for sites that are underfunded and understaffed. The amount of information that gets lost or altered would make your head spin. Still, I managed to find the articles you requested. Well at least some. I couldn't find the very first iteration but I did manage to get as far back as 2005. Even plugged them through our new revision highlighter for you. It completely omits repeated information, thing's great.</p> <p>After skimming myself, I understand why these aren't immediately available. Had to jump a few hoops, probably shouldn't have read them to be honest.</p> <p>Good luck on your research, be careful though. Reality bending can rot your brain.</p> <p>Bryan</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">4704_V10-06-2005.doc</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&lt;X&gt;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>RAISA REVISION FILTRATOR:</span></h3> <p><em>Revisions Have Been Highlighted, Redundant Information Omitted</em></p> </div> <p><strong>Item:</strong> SCP-4704</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> <span style="color: blue">Euclid</span></p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedure:</strong> <span style="color: blue">All SCP-4704 instances are to be transported to storage containment hangar 92-Δ of Area-92 located in Talamanca, Costa Rica. All personnel currently associated to SCP-4704 research team are now assigned to Area-92. HDD<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> monitors remain active within these buildings at all times. If a fluctuation in Hume level is detected, agents are to pin-point instances responsible and remove them for examination.</span></p> <p><strong>Description:</strong></p> <p><span style="color: blue">When several instances are simultaneously activated, designated a cluster-activation<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>, combined frequencies emitted will increase in strength. Cluster-activations produce significant hume field discrepancies, and the resulting modifications are severe, affecting a radius of up to 4000 meters. Recorded alterations include:</span></p> <ul> <li><span style="color: blue">Rapid growth of vegetation native to the South American region including many species of flora, trees, and foliage.</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Terrain deformation and seismic activity of a maximum magnitude of 7-8.</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Violent atmospheric disturbance and inconsistent meteorological shifts, usually resulting in tropical storms.</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Atmospheric and sedimentary purification.</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Gradual accumulation of anomalously manifested fresh water into a large singular body.</span></li> </ul> <p><span style="color: blue">Changes persist despite the cease of sonorous stimulation and are non reversible via standard methods.</span></p> <p><strong><span style="color: blue">Addendum 4704.01:</span></strong> Test Log-064</p> <p>The following is the first successfully recorded cluster-activation. After an extensive operation to publicly conceal incident, containment of SCP-4704 has been adjusted, including the construction of subterranean specialized containment area designated Area-92 to house all known instances of SCP-4704, and function as hub for SCP-4704 research team.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>4704 TEST LOG-164:</strong><br /> <strong>Subjects Tested:</strong> 4704-048, 4704-004, 4704-113<br /> <strong>Position Adjustment:</strong> SCP-4704-004 rotated 45° clockwise from prior position<br /> <strong>Object #:</strong> 028<br /> <strong>Object:</strong> Wooden Flute With Internal Wind Channel Of Native American Craft<br /> <strong>Procedure:</strong> D-15302 instructed to enter test chamber containing SCP-4704-048, -004, and -113 positioned in a acute triangle. D-15302 instructed to approach the center of containment chamber and to play a constant High G note.<br /> <strong>Effects:</strong><br /> <em>00:00:45</em>- Foliage completely overtakes chamber floor and walls.<br /> <em>00:01:20</em>- Instances of <em>Cedrela odorata</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup> and <em>Schizolobium parahyba</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup> sprout through floor and rapidly mature, penetrating roof of chamber.<br /> <em>00:02:02</em>- Terrain of site begins to shift.<br /> <em>00:02:10</em>- D-15302 has ceased playing High G note, however alterations continue.<br /> <em>00:03:15</em>- Foliage beings to extend to rest of facility.<br /> <em>00:06:10</em>- Foliage extends to exterior of site and beyond.<br /> <em>00:06:32</em>- Weather patterns begin to fluctuate, producing heavy winds and rain.<br /> <em>00:06:58</em>- Small body of water begins to generate 1000&#160;m the north of site.<br /> <em>00:07:13</em>- Region experiences seismic tremor.<br /> <em>00:07:49</em>- Seismic disturbances result in small protruding rupture of terrain within facility.<br /> <em>00:08:01</em>- Smoke escapes from rupture.<br /> <em>00:08:09</em>- D-15302 ordered to displace SCP-4704 instances<br /> <em>00:08:13</em>- D-15302 does as instructed. Modifications subside.</p> <p><strong>Results:</strong> Damage to structural integrity of Site 92. SCP-4704 affecting public vicinity. Containment breach of SCP-████ , SCP-████ , SCP-████ , and SCP-████.</p> </blockquote> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:400px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/inbox/Damage"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/inbox/Damage/medium.jpg" style="width:400px;" alt="Damage" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:400px;"> <p>Effects of cluster-activation within nearby area of ████ ███</p> </div> </div> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/b2e5b84994dc0bbe3e659d9f8b63933e29eddd02-11777521621225773735" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">4704_V02-08-2012.doc</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&lt;X&gt;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>RAISA REVISION FILTRATOR:</span></h3> <p><em>Revisions Have Been Highlighted, Redundant Information Omitted</em></p> </div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-4704</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedure:</strong></p> <p><span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ is to be kept in standard containment chamber of Area-42 also outfitted with a single SRA.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-5" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >5</a></sup>. SCP-4704-ö̀ does not require sustenance. In the event of SCP-4704-ö̀ breaching from chamber, security personnel are to record all actions of the subject, but make no aggressive response. If SCP-4704-ö̀ makes contact with SCP-4704 instances, security are not to respond with hostility and to prepare facility evacuation procedures. When conversing with SCP-4704-ö̀, information involving the Foundation is considered classified and not to be disclosed despite the subject's persistence.</span></p> <blockquote> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Researcher Note:</strong></span> Pardon my frankness, but I feel this should be said directly. This, if anything, can be considered an unorthodox method of containment, but an effective one. The anchors are mostly for show. Yes, they have some effect on SCP-4704-ö̀, but its understanding of hume field manipulation far exceeds our own. It is difficult to compete with an entity for which the bending of reality it seems is almost like a hobby. If SCP-4704-ö̀ wished to leave the site, there is very little we can do to prevent it at this time. The only real leverage we have over this entity is its apparent fascination with aspects of human society, and to a greater degree, of us. Humor it, answer its questions, be polite, take notes. If we play our roles correctly, then we may just learn a thing or two.</p> <p>Besides, as long as we have the stones, we have the monkey.</p> <p>- <em>Dr. Rodolfo, Lead Researcher</em></p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Description:</strong></p> <p><span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ is a sentient organic entity capable of altering the cellular composition of itself to an undocumented maximum degree and which currently resembles a male <em>Cebus capucinus</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-6" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >6</a></sup>. This entity demonstrates a high level of intelligence and is able to communicate through speech, despite the psychical limitations of its corporeal form. Additionally, SCP-4704-ö̀ demonstrates a resistance to the effects of hume field manipulation, capable of altering itself in spite of the presence of SRAs. It is currently theorized this is due to SCP-4704-ö̀'s form maintaining its own hume field which it manipulates freely without affecting surrounding hume fields. All these prior factors have made effectively containing SCP-4704-ö̀ untenable. However, SCP-4704-ö̀ has been cooperative with the Foundation and has agreed to refrain from causing public disturbance. In return, SCP-4704-ö̀ has requested frequent conversations with personnel, as well as access to SCP-4704 instances for the purpose of demonstrations.</span></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/inbox/Monkey"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/inbox/Monkey/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Monkey" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>SCP-4704-ö̀ answering researcher questions during a demonstration</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ has extensive knowledge of the nature of SCP-4704, claiming to be their source of origin. Though the foundation has no method of validating this claim, historical information offered by SCP-4704-ö̀ as well as its skill in the utilization of SCP-4704 suggest the claim is legitimate.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >7</a></sup> SCP-4704-ö̀ will often ask questions concerning history, recent events, economic or social status of individuals, and details of the Foundation's purpose.</span></p> <p><span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ frequently preforms demonstrations of SCP-4704's capabilities, claiming that it wishes to educate the Research Personnel. Since SCP-4704-ö̀'s arrival SCP-4704 instances have been recorded to produce the following additional effects:</span></p> <ul> <li><span style="color: blue">Rapid generation of foliage with no limitation of global region</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Atmospheric temperature alteration of no known maximum degree (decrease or increase)</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Alteration of surrounding surface area to the form of dried out soil, fertile soil, obsidian, coral, marble, solid ice, glass, concrete, wood, steel, an unknown sponge like substance, etc.</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Generation of self-originated fire, volcanic rock, sterile water, salt water, mist, dust particles, static electricity, and plasma</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Creation and rapid development of single cell organisms (hypothesized that if activation is indefinitely sustained ████ ██████ ███████ █████████)</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">████████████ within inorganic and organic subjects inside area of effect</span></li> <li><span style="color: blue">Complete ██████████████ ██ █████████ ███ ███████ inside area of effect</span></li> </ul> <p><sub><span style="color: blue">For in-depth record and analysis of spacial positioning and tones utilized by<br /> SCP-4704-ö̀ in order to produce the prior effects, please refer to the <em>&quot;4704-Position to Tone Relation Guide Volume 02&quot;</em></span></sub></p> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Addendum 4704.01:</strong></span> Incident Report SCP-4704-ö̀</p> <p>SCP-4704-ö̀ first came to the attention of the Foundation by his own accord on 11/03/11. SCP-4704-ö̀ entered Area-92, anomalously manifesting into storage containment hangar 92-Δ, triggering HDD monitors and notifying personnel of intrusion. SCP-4704-ö̀ began to interact with SCP-4704 instances until arrival of security personnel. Though firearms appeared to have no effect on SCP-4704-ö̀, the entity calmly obeyed instructions, speaking in an indiscernible language. SCP-4704-ö̀ was then held in an improvised containment chamber, as none were originally necessary in Area-92.</p> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Addendum 4704.02:</strong></span> Following the prior incident, it was soon discovered that SCP-4704-ö̀ speaks a tonal SOV language of the Chibchan family, spoken by some tribes of the indigenous Costa Rican population. Upon this discovery, a translator of said language was brought on site from the Foundation's Linguistic Division. The following interview was conducted by said researcher upon his arrival.</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-4704-ö̀</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Dr. Muñoz</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> Transcription translated to English.</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Hello</p> <p><em>Subject does not respond. Appears to be inspecting a small object.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Hello?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Ah, sorry. You speak Bribri?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Yes. What is that?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Don't know. You should. In your weapons.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> A bullet?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> &lt;Bulit&gt;? Small, but hurts.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Yes, I apologize-</p> <p><em>Subject smiles.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Don't. Don't. I like new. There is much new, for me. I've been gone. Long time.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Gone? Gone where?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Too long, but returned now. Thank you.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> I don't understand.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> You use stones, yes?<br /> <br /> <strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> I believe we did. You know what they are then?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Yes, yes, my stones. Bring me back. Yes. Glad to be back.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> You claim them?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I made them, so they are mine. My stones. I am Sibú. Yes, that's me. Creator of stones.<br /> <br /> <strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Wait you- you are-</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Yes, yes, Sibú. Creator of man. Creator of Earth. That's me. I'm back. Your use, eh no, worship, your worship of my stones returned me.</p> <p><em>Dr. Muñoz pauses</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> I don't- I'm sorry. Sibú was a man, no?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Disguise. Needed disguise. Weak, also. Both. Disguised and weak. Weak without worship.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> I see. So, our music, that was worship to you?</p> <p><em>Subject appears thoughtful. Subject then laughs and tilts head.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Yes! Music! Music&#8230; Yes. Need music for the worship, do my miracles through stone. You worship me, keep worshiping me, I help you more. More miracles.<br /> <br /> <strong>Dr. Muñoz:</strong> Well, we'll have to consider that. We are not in a position to promise more, um, worship.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Grateful anyways! You, [ <em>Subject points to Dr. Rodolfo, who had been watching the proceedings.</em> ] you remember where you come from. You remember, so I show you how to worship. Do many things. Do anything. You already saw.<br /> <br /> <br /> <strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Behavior of SCP-4704-ö̀ during interview leaves researches uncertain of its sincerity. Despite this, request to continue testing with assistance of SCP-4704-ö̀ was authorized by O5 council, which lead to discovery of numerous additional effects.</p> </blockquote> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Addendum 4704.02:</strong></span> Findings Report</p> <p>The following is a report on research carried out by lead researcher Dr. Rodolfo into the origin and possible nature of SCP-4704-ö̀.</p> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/inbox/Sibu"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/inbox/Sibu/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Sibu" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Articulated gold pendant representing Sibú with the head of an eagle. Pre-Columbian Gold Museum, San José Costa Rica.</p> </div> </div> <blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Analysis of Costa Rican Historical Context in Relation to SCP-4704</span></strong><br /> L. Rodolfo, Lead Researcher, Area-92</p> <p>I find it pertinent to note that following my assignment to SCP-4704, I performed independent research into the the local Mesoamerican tribes of the Diquis Delta province. During this research I stumbled upon the name Sibú in context to a hero and creation deity figure. However, I did not initially find this information relevant to our studies of SCP-4704 effects. With the appearance of a reality bending entity claiming to be said deity, I have decided preform an in depth investigation of this legend with the assistance of The Folklore/Mythology Unit (FMU) of the Field Research Department.<br /> <br /> This subject was said to be a member of an ancient demon race, titled the Sòrburu, which ruled the Earth prior to man. Sibú confronted and defeated his own people, taking reign over the Earth and becoming the principal deity of this mythology. Sibú then began to shape the planet itself, giving it a new form to his liking. There is the presence of objects titled &quot;magical rocks&quot; throughout this legend and it carries thematic similarities to SCP-4704's anomalous nature.</p> <p>I believe this story and the newly arrived entity to, at the very least, speak some notion of the truth. The relationship between SCP-4704-ö̀ and the ancient civilizations is as of yet unclear, but we can be certain SCP-4704 are of its creation.</p> </blockquote> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/b2e5b84994dc0bbe3e659d9f8b63933e29eddd02-781837934834068135" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">4704_V12-10-2015.doc</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&lt;X&gt;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>RAISA REVISION FILTRATOR:</span></h3> <p><em>Revisions Have Been Highlighted, Redundant Information Omitted</em></p> </div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-4704</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> <span style="color: blue">Thaumiel</span><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-8" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >8</a></sup></p> <div style="background: url(http://kaktuskontainer.wdfiles.com/local--files/format-hell/scp_trans.png) bottom center no-repeat; text-align: center; width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 20px; padding: 0px;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><span style="color: black">BY ORDER OF THE OVERSEER COUNCIL</span></span></h2> <p><span style="color: black">Access to this file restricted to personnel with Level 4 or higher Delta (Δ) clearance set. Attempt to access file without necessary clearance will be logged and result in immediate disciplinary action.</span></p> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: black">4704</span></strong></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#f2f2c2; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>Following the neutralization of SCP-4704, clearance requisites for access to this file have been lifted by <strong>The O5 Council</strong> and <strong>The Records And Information Security Administration</strong> on 02\29\2016</em></p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedure:</strong> <span style="color: blue">All research personnel assigned to Area-92 are required to possess a copy of the <em>4704-Position to Tone Relation Guide Volume 5</em> as supplied by on site database. Activation of instances for use in the Delta Enclosure Project requires Level 5-Δ clearance and authorization of 4704 Lead Researcher. Personnel assigned to Area-92 must regularly undergo a reality-dissonance psych assessment.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-9" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >9</a></sup> Personnel given Level 4/5-Δ clearance must take a RPR Examination<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-10" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >10</a></sup> and undergo a 1 month background check of antecedent assignments.</span></p> <p><span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ has been given authorization to operate as a consultant during the construction of additional ████████ ██████████ ██████████ (███).<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-864831-11" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >11</a></sup></span></p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> <span style="color: blue">SCP-4704-ö̀ has shown to be capable of altering the cellular composition of itself to an unlimited degree, changing its corporeal form often. Its forms usually consist of local wild life, and a human male of seemingly Latin American descent. SCP-4704-ö̀ has also been able to adeptly learn a multitude of modern languages and expressions.</span></p> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/6d163fc736661cb06e59fec02bf2f24c053e3b31-1900076932515822148" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Addendum 4704.01:</strong></span> Containment Committee Proposal</p> <blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Thaumielic Revision of SCP-4704: Proposal #013</span></strong></p> <p><strong>Project Name:</strong> Delta Enclosure</p> <p><strong>Proposed Utilization:</strong> [REDACTED]</p> <hr /> <p><strong>ETHICS COMMITTEE VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span><br /> <strong>LOGISTICS DEPARTMENT VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span><br /> <strong>O5 COUNCIL VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span></p> </blockquote> <p><span style="color: blue"><strong>Addendum 4704.02:</strong></span> Delta Enclosure Project Briefing And Test Log</p> <p><strong>[DATA EXPUNGED]</strong></p> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/b2e5b84994dc0bbe3e659d9f8b63933e29eddd02-13608414891341350603" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>Dr.Gutierrez &lt;<span class="wiki-email">rc.PiCS|zerreitug.b#rc.PiCS|zerreitug.b</span>&gt;</strong><br /> <strong>Tue 2/12/2019&#160;3:35 AM</strong><br /> <strong><span class="wiki-email">ten.PiCS|zevahc.g#ten.PiCS|zevahc.g</span></strong></p> <p>Gabriel,</p> <p>You have a problem. While looking for this, it became quickly apparent to me that I'm wading into waters well above my pay grade. This is all I could really get you. Everything else about the project has been scorched from what I can tell. Even this got me nearly detained. I'm fine, but that's about it for favors. Look, I get the interest, considering your department. Even I'm shocked this was going on in our backyard. But whatever happened, they're not bringing this program back, new stones or no new stones.</p> <p>I'd leave it alone, and don't be surprised if you get called in soon.</p> <p>Bryan</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">4704_TR13.doc</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&lt;X&gt;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Thaumielic Revision SCP-4704: Proposal #013</span></strong></p> <p><strong>Project Name:</strong> Delta Enclosure</p> <p><strong>Proposed Utilization:</strong> Implementing SCP-4704 into specialized containment units, outfitted with automated audio cues and positioning mechanisms based on data complied in <em>Position to Tome Relation Guide</em> volumes classified as Adaptive Containment Enclosures (ACEs).</p> <p>Each individual ACE would be capable of anomalously manipulating the interior of the enclosure. This allows each unit to adapt itself to the necessary requirements dictated by the special containment procedures of the subject it carries, without the need of external resource. This methodology would be self sufficient and has a potential of utilization against vast quantity of entities and objects.</p> <p>Additionally, ACEs would be capable of disintegrating their contents if so desired. This offers for a humane termination of dangerous or unstable subjects, as well as a fail safe against potential containment breaches.<br /></p> <hr /> <p><strong>ETHICS COMMITTEE VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span><br /> <strong>LOGISTICS DEPARTMENT VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span><br /> <strong>O5 COUNCIL VERDICT:</strong> <span style="color: green">APPROVED</span></p> </blockquote> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/b2e5b84994dc0bbe3e659d9f8b63933e29eddd02-14482561921830716751" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>Gabe, if you're reading this, Isaac managed to get the drive to you. I trust him, I hope you do too. They obviously screen everything that gets sent. I considered just giving it to you in person, too risky. Burn the note after you read it, I'd rather not be terminated due to idiotic curiosity and stubbornness. I hate you for turning me on to this, but I owe it to you enough to share what I found.</p> <p>I'm not sure what to believe anymore.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Gabriel.doc</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&lt;X&gt;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>Containment Committee Proposal CASE 91500200</strong><br /> <strong>Adjacent Document #003:</strong></p> <p><strong>Transcript Of Recorded Conversation Between Doctor Luis Rodolfo Gutierrez and SCP-4704-ö̀ on 2/10/2016</strong></p> <p>Forward: Text translated from Spanish</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Superfluous Data Redacted</strong></p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> And as long the water maintains this volume it should remain inert. That would be easy enough, yes?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Mmm</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Are you listening? This is important for us.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Are you religious Fito?</p> <p><em>Dr. Rodolfo sighs</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> I've asked you not to call me that.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Catholic?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Why?</p> <p><em>Subject laughs.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I thought not.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> You seem distracted. Is something wrong?</p> <p><em>SCP-4704-ö̀ reveals several sheets of Foundation documentation.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I've been reading these, and I'm confused by something.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> What- Oh for the love of- How did you get those?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> They say that I claim to be Sibú. Just claim, that means you aren't convinced that I am him, right?<br /> <br /> <strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Well&#8230; we can't be sure can we?<br /> <br /> <strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Not sure? You're not sure I'm a god after the things I do?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> There are more things out there that can do what you do, and they aren't all gods.</p> <p><em>Subject smiles.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Yes. Interesting. So then, if not a god, what do you think I am?<br /> <br /> <strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Alright. I guess you've earned this much. We would classify you as a reality bender. And we think you're in some way responsible for the stones, as you claim to be. And, at the very least, we know you think you're Sibú.</p> <p><em>Subject laughs.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Really? You know that for a fact?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Well don't you?</p> <p><em>Pause</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> What I think doesn't matter. It never did. All that matters is what you think.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> You've certainly always put a lot of importance on the opinion of others.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> You misunderstand.</p> <p><em>SCP-4704-ö̀ flips through documentation, arriving to a specific page.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Why do you think the poor Mr. Jones managed to make flowers?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> You mean the musician? We assumed he got lucky.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Honestly, you people more than anyone ought to know better.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Then how?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> He believed he could.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> What?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> He said as much himself.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong>&#8230;Jones believed the stones were made by some kind of aliens. UFOs. Conspiracies. He was a nut. He knew nothing about-</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> He believed he could make &quot;something beautiful&quot; by playing near the stones, it's all that was needed really.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> It can't be that simple. The position of the stones, the tone he played, if he hadn't accidentally done the worship correctly nothing would've happened. If all he needed was belief then why not us?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Because you never believed it could be that simple.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Do you mean to say it's all been arbitrary?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> You overthought it. The way my kind operate is straight forward. We are born of belief, and we die when we're forgotten. We do whatever your kind thinks we can do. Many years ago your kind thought there was a god named Sibú that molded the Earth for them, and so I am, and so I did.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> If you created man how could man create you?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Have you ever heard of the chicken and the egg?</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Enough! The belief of one mundane person is not enough to bend reality.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Ah, but the belief of many can move mountains. It can make sulfur rain and oceans flood. And sometimes all it takes is a few, maybe even one. One that genuinely believes. [ <em>SCP-4704-ö̀ motions to paper</em> ] a deranged man, or [ <em>SCP-4704-ö̀ motion to Dr. Rodolfo</em> ] a man reading a name.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Me?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I meant it when I said I had you to thank for being back.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> We've been using the stones far before I ever read about you.</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Yes, thanks to poor Mr. Jones. He had you believe the stones worked with music, and so they did. Then you believed maybe they could be capable of more, and so they were. And then maybe even more. I say, you Foundation folk are prepared to believe anything. I don't blame you, considering the job.</p> <p><em>SCP-4704-ö̀ reveals another document and begins reading</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Such terrible things you see.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> That's- How are you getting these? We had an agreement!</p> <p><em>Dr. Rodolfo attempts to take document away from subject, is unsuccessful.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> To answer your prior question, no I don't think I'm Sibú. At least not the Sibú I was. I'm something else now, thanks to you. Something new. A reality bender I think is what you said. The world changed while I was gone, and because of that so have I.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> &#8230;Why reveal this to me? We know now your existence depends on us. Your power. So why tell us so?</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> That's how I used to see it too, but, recently, I realized it isn't so simple.</p> <p><em>Containment Chamber begins to shake</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I'm a reality bender now Fito. I'm capable of anything, as long as you believe it. And now you can't help but to believe it.</p> <p><em>SCP-4704-ö̀ levitates itself and Dr. Rodolfo.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Wha- How are you-</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> I mean, you can't just stop believing I can do these things. You know that I can. At best you could forget.</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> Stop this! Stop this Sibú!</p> <p><em>Entirety of Area-92 and surroundings begin to experience a multitude of anomalous transformations. Large portions of site structure are replaced with a limestone replica. Tropical forest overtakes surroundings. There is degeneration of clothing and technology developed after the pre-Columbian Mesoamerica period.</em></p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> As a god I had competition, and I could do what? Change my shape? Control the weather? Mold the Earth? Now I can mold the universe! Thank you, truly, thank you!</p> <p><strong>Dr. Rodolfo:</strong> If you don't stop we'll forget! We can! We can force everyone, even ourselves!</p> <p><strong>SCP-4704-ö̀:</strong> Honestly, my friend, why should you? My gifts will help you do many things! They'll help you do anything! You already saw!</p> <p><em>SCP-4704-ö̀ vanishes. Subsequently, all anomalous transformations underway cease.</em></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Notation:</strong> <em>We gave it this power, so it's our responsibility to diminish it. We tried to maintain a lie with the Neutralized article, but the stones are very much still active, and they require only a thought to cause discrepancies now. We cannot allow ourselves to be bribed by these &quot;gifts&quot;. Destroy them, amnesticize everyone, even the O5. Stop the belief at its roots. - Dr. Rodolfo</em></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/inbox/html/f012edb6788678028641331d8143de9d62d29f3d-8599043591488872804" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theslothsavant" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2192823&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608692370" alt="TheSlothSavant" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2192823)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theslothsavant" >TheSlothSavant</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Hume Discrepancy Detection ; see E&amp;TS manual: <em>Reality Anchors, Reality Benders, And YOU!</em></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. See <em>Addendum 4704.01: Test Log-064</em></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Spanish cedar</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. Gallinazo tree</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. See <em>Addendum 4704.01: Incident Report 4704-ö̀</em></div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. white-headed capuchin</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. See Addendum 4704.02: Findings Report</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-8"><a href="javascript:;" >8</a>. See Addendum 4704.01: Containment Committee Proposal</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-9"><a href="javascript:;" >9</a>. See MD Publication: <em>Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy</em> pp 002-017</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-10"><a href="javascript:;" >10</a>. Reality Perception Resistance Examination; See MD Publication: <em>Reality Bent: The Adverse Effects On Mental Health When Exposed To Hume Field Discrepancy</em> pp 304-330</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-864831-11"><a href="javascript:;" >11</a>. See <em>Addendum 4704.02: Delta Enclosure Project Briefing And Test Log</em></div> </div> 
